<title>BELGIUM: Belgian liquidity unchanged at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgian liquidity unchanged at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Bank left liquidity virtually unchanged at its fixed-rate tender for seven-day advances. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date Aug 28	 expiry on Sept 4</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	   15.575 bln bfr    (15.325 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.20 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    15.575 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted 100 pct</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on Aug 28</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810</p>
</text>
